s = 0x0200 + 54*4 + 1 = 0x0200+216+1 = 0x02D9. Hmm list_sprites showed index 54 tile 113, so OAM tile byte at 0x0200 + 54*4 + 1 = 0x2D9. Trace write on CPU 0x02D9 length 1 for 60 frames → gives the PC that writes it. Disassemble around to find the routine and table.\n\nBut the Goomba is currently on screen (index 54/55/56/57). The game is running; the","truncated":true}
